IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Returned to Commons 2026-10-21: the stable l4 (1.6.98) daydate has no YMD;
-- this local shim is the lenient Date in ISO argument order. It lives in its
-- own module so that family-domain.l4 keeps its rule of stating no rule.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      m IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
YMD y m d MEANS Date d m y
